/PlrRR {MlrRR fill } bdef
/MtbRR {/lry xdef /lrx xdef /uly xdef /ulx xdef /rad lrx ulx sub 2 div def
  newpath tMatrix currentmatrix pop ulx rad add uly rad add translate
